{'symbol': 'HWM', 'date': '2021-05-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'HOWMET AEROSPACE COMPLETES EARLY REDEMPTION OF 5.87% NOTES DUE 2022', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HOWMET AEROSPACE INC. (NYSE:HWM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE EARLY REDEMPTION OF ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 5.87% NOTES DUE 2022 (THE “2022 NOTES”) IN THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $476.2 MILLION. THE 2022 NOTES WERE REDEEMED WITH CASH ON HAND AT AN AGGREGATE REDEMPTION PRICE OF APPROXIMATELY $503.3 MILLION, INCLUDING ACCRUED INTEREST. FOLLOWING THE REDEMPTION OF THE 2022 NOTES, THE COMPANY'S NEXT DEBT MATURITY IS IN OCTOBER 2024. ABOUT HOWMET AEROSPAC"}